# gh release delete v1 --repo alice/site --yes
### read
GET https://api.github.com/repos/alice/site/releases/tags/v1
accept: application/vnd.github.merge-info-preview+json, application/vnd.github.nebula-preview
content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
user-agent: GitHub CLI 2.83.2


### read
POST https://api.github.com/graphql
accept: application/vnd.github.merge-info-preview+json, application/vnd.github.nebula-preview
content-type: application/json
graphql-features: merge_queue
user-agent: GitHub CLI 2.83.2

{"query":"query RepositoryReleaseByTag($name:String!$owner:String!$tagName:String!){repository(owner: $owner, name: $name){release(tagName: $tagName){databaseId,isDraft}}}","variables":{"name":"site","owner":"alice","tagName":"v1"}}


### write
DELETE https://api.github.com/repos/alice/site/releases/9
accept: application/vnd.github.merge-info-preview+json, application/vnd.github.nebula-preview
content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
user-agent: GitHub CLI 2.83.2

